痛劑"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"骨骼切片"}]},{"type":"text","value":"最準確；開放性骨折後發燒、寒顫、患肢持續疼痛、拒絕移動；治療不包括放射線；按時服抗生素、患肢固定抬高、傷口癒合前不做全關節運動、高壓氧時做耳壓平衡；高熱量高蛋白與維生素 C。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"帶狀疱疹：沿單側皮節、神經痛、可濕冷敷、不會終身免疫。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"疥瘡：接觸隔離、家人同治、全身塗藥、衣物熱水清洗。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}}],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"皮膚軟組織感染多由"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"金黃色葡萄球菌"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(化膿、膿瘍)與 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"A 群鏈球菌"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(擴散、界線不清)造成。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"蜂窩性組織炎"}]},{"type":"text","value":"：抬高患肢、臥床制動、觀察紅腫範圍；"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"丹毒"}]},{"type":"text","value":"界線分明、隆起；"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"壞死性筋膜炎"}]},{"type":"text","value":"疼痛與外觀不成比例，需緊急清創。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"骨髓炎"}]},{"type":"text","value":"：最常見是金黃色葡萄球菌；"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"骨骼切片"}]},{"type":"text","value":"最準確；需長期抗生素，患肢固定抬高。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"ele